[39m\n                \u001b[33mrole\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"tooltip\"\u001b[39m\n                \u001b[33mstyle\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"transform: translateX(8px);\"\u001b[39m\n              \u001b[36m>\u001b[39m\n                \u001b[36m<strong>\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[0mSMS\u001b[0m\n                \u001b[36m</strong>\u001b[39m\n                \u001b[36m<span>\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[0mThe SMS card lists the messages on the SIM or in the phone memory, and shows how many of the modem's places they use. Read shows a message's sender, time and text, and works during a harness run, because it only reads. Tick messages and press Delete to remove them: the card shows the exact command first, and deleting waits for a harness run to end. If the list changed since the preview, the app says so and you preview again. Send SMS takes a number and a text of 1 to 160 characters of the GSM basic set (letters, digits and common punctuation; for example @, $ and accented letters are refused). Its preview warns that the carrier may charge for the message, and sending also waits for a harness run to end. The app never writes a message's text to the audit log, only the command and the number.\u001b[0m\n                \u001b[36m</span>\u001b[39m\n                \u001b[36m<a\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[33mhref\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"https://github.com/dm17ryk/OpenWrtGUI/wiki/LTE-modem#sms\"\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[33mrel\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"noopener noreferrer\"\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[33mtarget\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"_blank\"\u001b[39m\n                \u001b[36m>\u001b[39m\n                  \u001b[0mMore in the manual\u001b[0m\n                \u001b[36m</a>\u001b[39m\n              \u001b[36m</span>\u001b[39m\n            \u001b[36m</span>\u001b[39m\n          \u001b[36m</div>\u001b[39m\n        \u001b[36m</div>\u001b[39m\n        \u001b[36m<div\u001b[39m\n          \u001b[33mclass\u001b[39m=\u001b[32m\"note x\"\u001b[39m\n